OL,3,GNEWSAPolice dogs named after officers
OL,4,Akilled in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FPuppies being trained to work as police
OL,7,Fdogs have been named in memory of two
OL,8,Fofficers killed in a head-on car crash.
OL,10,FPC Matthew Blades and PC Tom Clough
OL,11,Fdied when a Volkswagen Passat
OL,12,Ftravelling the wrong way on the A66 in
OL,13,FSouth Bank, near Middlesbrough, crashed
OL,14,Finto their marked police car on 22
OL,15,FAugust.
OL,17,FIn their honour, two five-month-old
OL,18,Fcocker spaniels that have joined the
OL,19,FDog Support Unit at Cleveland Police
OL,20,Fhave been named Bladesy and Tommy.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
