OL,3,GNEWSAPolice dogs named after officers
OL,4,Akilled in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We are certain they will live up to
OL,7,Ftheir namesakes in making wonderful
OL,8,Fcolleagues to work alongside," Acting
OL,9,FSgt Chris Lambert said.
